    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis spacious four-bedroom detached home is set on a generous 0.19 hectare site, just 1 km from the popular seaside resort of Kilkee on the Wild Atlantic Way in West Clare. Offering a combination of space, convenience and proximity to the coast, the property would make an ideal permanent family home or holiday retreat.\n\nBlock wall boundaries to the front open onto a large tarmac driveway providing ample space for parking, with a detached garage positioned to the side. Lawn areas extend from the front around the side to the rear of the property with a selection of mature shrubs, providing plenty of outdoor space to enjoy.\n\nThe location is particularly appealing for families, with a preschool within walking distance of the property and primary and secondary schools available in the town itself. The town offers a wide range of everyday amenities and services, ideal for day to day living.\n\nKilkee is particularly renowned for its distinctive horseshoe-shaped beach, pollock holes and spectacular cliff walk. The longer Kilkee Cliff Walk route passes directly along the front boundary of the property, providing immediate access to one of the area's most scenic coastal attractions.\n\nWith Kilkee town and beach within a short distance, this home is well suited to a family looking to relocate to the West Clare coast or for those lookng for a holiday home or coastal getaway in West Clare.\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by prior appointment with sole selling agents. PLS002295"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 3.6m x 3.52m\nTile flooring directly inside the door with timber style flooring through the rest of the hallway, carpeted hip style staircase leading to first floor landing with storage underneath, door to hot press, doors to main reception, kitchen, utility bedroom one and two and main bathroom.\n\nMain Reception - 5.35m x 4m\nTimber flooring, front and side aspect windows, gas fireplace with timber surround, marble insert and raised marble flag, decorative ceiling coving, built-in units with base storage and overhead glass display units and exposed shelving, double doors to formal dining room.\n\nDining Room - 4m x 3.5m\nTimber flooring, double doors leading to patio and rear garden, decorative ceiling coving and door to kitchen.\n\nKitchen - 3.4m x 3.3m\nTile flooring, built-in wall and base units with ample work surfaces, tile splash back, single drainer sink, space for fridge freezer, oven and dishwasher, integrated extractor hood and fan and open access to sunroom.\n\nSunroom - 4.05m x 3m\nTile flooring, windows on three sides with side door access and vaulted ceiling with timber cladding and velux.\n\nUtility Room - 3.6m x 1.7m\nTile flooring, rear aspect window, rear door access, built-in wall and base units with ample work surfaces, tile splash back and single drainer sink.\n\nHot Press - 4m x 3.5m\nFront aspect window, shelving, houses water tank.\n\nBedroom One - 4m x 3.5m\nTimber flooring, rear aspect window, wall to wall built-in wardrobes with ample hanging rails and storage with integrated sink with wall mounted mirror and wall mounted lighting.\n\nMain Bathroom - 2.9m x 1.75m\nTile flooring, half and half timber and tile wall decor, side aspect window, low level wc, wash hand basin with overhead wall mounted mirror, corner bath unit with overhead electric shower.\n\nBedroom Two - 4m x 3.5m\nTimber style flooring and front aspect window.\n\nFirst Floor Landing - \nCarpeted flooring, front aspect window, door to storage into the eves and doors to bedroom three and four.\n\nBedroom Three - 3.35m x 3.2m\nCarpeted flooring, rear aspect window and door to en-suite.\n\nEn-Suite - 1.8m x 1.6m\nFully tiled ceiling to floor, rear aspect window, low level wc, wash hand basin with base vanity unit and overhead wall mounted mirror, electric wall mounted heater, corner fitted shower with electric shower and sliding glass panel doors.\n\nBedroom Four - 3.6m x 3.25m\nCarpeted flooring, sliding glass door to front aspect balcony, front aspect window and door to en-suite.\n\nEn-Suite - 1.85m x 1.65m\nTile flooring, part wall tiling, low level wc, wash hand basin with overhead wall mounted mirror and corner fitted shower with sliding glass panel doors.\n\nDetached Garage - 7.25m x 4.5m\n\n\nOutside - \nFront - Block wall boundaries, tarmac drive with ample space for parking, detached garage and lawn area with mature trees and hedging.Rear - Patio and large lawn to the rear.\n\nBalcony - 5m x 1.55m\nConcrete flooring and views Kilkee in the distance.\n\n"
      },
